WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.678
After detecting duplicates define a survivor rule A
row with

00:00:05.704 --> 00:00:11.560
more useful fields might rank higher A more recent
record might be preferred

00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:17.406
when recency is meaningful Some systems have a
designated authoritative

00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:24.131
source And ties should be broken deterministically
The

00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:29.512
important point is that survivor selection is a
policy not an automatic property of SQL
